  - Scholz-Brauer conjecture
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalisation of the general marked Hansen construction, including
  allocation, sorted replay and the exact n-1+r addition count. The release
  proves ell(2^12509-1) <= 12525 and 16 <= ell(12509) <= 17 in Lean.
  It also includes independently checked computational evidence for
  ell(12509)=17; that equality and the end-to-end Scholz instance at 12509
  are not yet proved in Lean. The classical theorem is not claimed as new,
  and priority for this formalisation has not been established. Development
  used OpenAI Codex extensively; no independent human peer review is claimed.
